{"product_id":"spill-simmer-falter-wither","title":"Spill simmer falter wither","description":"\u003cp\u003eA misfit man finds a misfit dog. Ray, aged fifty-seven, 'too old for starting over, too young for giving up', and One Eye, a vicious little bugger, smaller than expected a good ratter. Both are accustomed to being alone, unloved, outcast - but they quickly find in each other a strange companionship. As spring turns to summer, their relationship grows and intensifies, until a savage act forces them to abandon the precarious life they'd established, and take to the road. A wholly different kind of love story, Spill Simmer Falter Wither is a devasting portrait of loneliness and loss, and of the restorative power of friendship.--Book cover.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Spill simmer falter wither\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099592747\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 277\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 18 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594308751513,"sku":"8RB9780099592747","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/spill-simmer-falter-wither-678641.jpg?v=1694791622","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/spill-simmer-falter-wither","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}